  "trivia": [
    "Loatle is a Breeder Tier Temtem by Tutorxic, who pledged $6000 to the Kickstarter. The design process for Pupoise and Loatle was shown on the \"The Latest Breeder Tems and Route!\" update on Crema's website.",
    "Loatle is one of three Temtem that change one of the types their pre-evolved form has upon evolving. In this case, swapping Nature for Mental. The others are Owlhe and Waspeen.",
    "Loatle is 1 of only 6 temtem with a sticker on the official Temtem Discord that didn't have to go through a sticker poll."
